=== IO Module Test Suite Complete ===

Summary:
- Tested io_read_bytes with various sizes
- Tested io_write_bytes and io_append_bytes
- Tested offset-based reading/writing (io_read_at, io_write_at)
- Tested io_seek_read for reading from offset to end
- Tested io_file_metadata for files and directories
- Tested io_truncate for both shrinking and extending files
- Tested io_copy_range for copying byte ranges
- Tested edge cases: empty files, reading past EOF, etc.